      "writtenOn": "2021-04-14T18:19:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "All the transformation logic started out in cc/bp2build.go, being called by bp2BuildListHeadersInDir() only. I think all the paths were relative paths, so it was an easy assumption to make.\n\nJin asked me to move everything to android/paths.go and call the transformation logic for BazelLabelForModuleSrc(), so maybe that assumption should be revisited now. It does seem surprising that we would generate an absolute path that wasn\u0027t valid, but I guess it could happen. \n\nThat said, unless this currently blocks something, I suggest we wait and see whether it becomes a problem?",
      "parentUuid": "8b7274af_c03342c9",
      "revId": "fb25faab71e2408cfa6ecdcc9d7d69c4137199aa",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
